    "updated_at": "2023-03-10T15:40:41Z",
    "body": "I think this is use case is best served by just using iframes as they are different documents already that can be rendered independently. However, currently iframes are a bit clunky and can put some constraints on potential UIs due to those rough edges, but I believe it would be better for browser vendors to focus on improving the UX of iframes to solve this use case over what is proposed here.",
