    "body": "I think it will be impossible to realize it properly with iframes since iframes are loaded in isolated containers, and each of them fetch to a different URI context.\r\nTo be exact, it was done by iframes by a lot of old sites but this technic was abandonnated. And this is normal, because iframes are not designed for it, but to integrate an entire document...",
